# Admin Assets

## JavaScript (`admin/js/edminboost-admin.js`)

- Wrap in an IIFE with `'use strict'`.
- Guard on `window.edminboostData` before running.
- Scope DOM queries to `.edminboost-wrap` or plugin-specific selectors.
- No jQuery unless WordPress already loads it for the screen.
- Use `DOMContentLoaded` for initialization.
- On `DOMContentLoaded`, call `initCommandCenterNav()`, `initPickerCloseOnScroll()`, `reinitEdminboostPage( root )`, and `primeCommandCenterHistory()`.
- `reinitEdminboostPage( root )` sets `data-edminboost-ready="true"`, sets `autocomplete="off"` on CC/settings forms, runs `restoreFormControlDefaults()` (syncs controls to server-rendered `default*` attributes, then re-dispatches `change` after a tick for live previews), and runs all page inits — also called after CC tab AJAX swaps.
- Module refs: `syncPresetCatalogFn`, `syncThemeSettingsFn` (set by `initLayoutPresetPicker` / `initTheme`; called from `applySettingsSaveResult()`), `syncThemeExtrasPreviewFn` (set by `initThemeExtras`; called from `updateThemePreview()`), `syncDeclutterPreviewThemeFn` (set by `initDeclutterPreview`; called from `updateThemePreview()`), `pendingDashboardOverviewSave` (in-flight overview save Promise; CC nav waits before swapping tabs).
- Page-specific init functions: `initCommandCenterNav` (CC tab AJAX nav), `initSetupWizard` (Dashboard first-run wizard), `initLayoutPresetPicker` (setup wizard + Layout Presets + Dashboard overview compact picker), `initDashboardOverview` (post-setup overview inline save), `initMapper`, `initMenuStudio`, `initBehavior` (Top Bar page panel/badges), `initTheme`, `initThemeExtras` (Appearance extras live preview + schedule dependent section), `initDeclutterPreview` (Appearance declutter live preview), `initWhiteLabel` (White Label master toggle + status/rebrand live previews), `initSecurityFeatures` (Security login redirects master toggle), `initProductivityFeatures` (Productivity stacked live previews + dashboard widgets + admin footer master toggles), `initPerformanceFeatures` (Performance emoji scope + asset toggle live previews), `initPresets` (Layout Presets actions), `initCommandCenterForms`, `initSettingsForm`, `initFormResetButtons` (Reset to defaults confirm + CC tab reload), `initBackupSettings` (Settings export/import), `initProLocks` (Free-tier `.is-pro-locked` section disabling) — each no-ops if target elements are absent.
- `initBehavior` delegates to `initBehaviorBadgePreview` (toggle badge style previews), `initBehaviorDrawerWidthCustom` (custom width slider + live preview), and `initBehaviorAnimationSpeed` (animation speed listbox + drawer micro-previews).

`edminboostData` shape:

```javascript
{
	version: string,
	isPro: boolean,           // EDMINBOOST_Pro::is_active()
	billingUrl: string,       // EDMINBOOST_Pro::get_billing_url()
	canSaveCustomPreset: boolean,
	currentPage: string,
	optionName: 'edminboost_settings',
	strings: {
		ready, configureItem, removeFromTopBar, emptyCanvas, exportSuccess,
		customLinkPathRequired, customLinkLabelRequired, customLinkPathInvalid,
		customLinkAnchorInvalid, customLinkDuplicate, drawerPreviewFailed,
		drawerWidthPreviewCaption, settingsSaved, settingsSaveFailed,
		presetApplied, presetNameRequired, presetSaved, presetDuplicated, skinSaved,
		proPresetLocked, proThemeLocked,
		emptyMenuCanvas, removeFromSidebar, customMenuPathRequired, customMenuLabelRequired,
		customMenuPathInvalid, customMenuDuplicate, selectLayoutPreset, saveAndLaunch,
		presetBadgeBuiltIn, presetBadgeSaved, presetBadgeVirtual, emptyLayoutPreview,
		emptySidebarPreview, previewWordPressLogo, previewProfile,
		pageLoading, pageLoadFailed,
		formResetConfirm, formResetConfirmYes, formResetCancel
	},
	presets: object,          // resolved preset layouts for JS (top_bar_items, sidebar_items, menu_studio, visible_*_slugs, requiresPro)
	roleMatrix: {             // Layout Presets role visibility matrix
		protectedSlugs, protectedSlugsByRole, accessibleSlugsByRole
	},
	presetCategories: object, // category labels from EDMINBOOST_Command_Center::get_preset_categories()
	themePresets: object,     // from EDMINBOOST_Theme::get_presets_for_js() (includes requiresPro)
	themeColorLabels: object, // from EDMINBOOST_Theme::get_color_labels()
	themeSettings: object,    // from EDMINBOOST_Theme::get_settings() — current theme preset/mode/font/custom colors
	settingsSave: { ajaxUrl, action: 'edminboost_save_settings' },
	ccNav: {                   // CC tab navigation without full reload
		ajaxUrl, action: 'edminboost_load_cc_page', nonce
	},
	lookSkins: object,        // from EDMINBOOST_Command_Center::get_look_skins()
	drawerPreview: {          // Layout Studio only
		ajaxUrl, action: 'edminboost_cc_drawer_preview', nonce
	}
}
```

## Command Center bar JS (`admin/js/edminboost-command-center-bar.js`)

- Separate from plugin-screen `edminboost-admin.js` — enqueued only when the live bar has drawer items.
- Wrap in an IIFE with `'use strict'`; guard on `window.edminboostCcBar.drawerItems`.
- Requires `#edminboost-cc-drawer` shell from `render_drawer_shell()`.

`edminboostCcBar` shape:

```javascript
{
	drawerItems: {
		'edminboost-cc-{hash}': { slug, label, frameUrl, openUrl }
	},
	animationMs: number,  // from behavior animation_speed
	iframeTitle: string   // accessible iframe label
}
```

- Opens drawer on `#wpadminbar .edminboost-cc-bar-drawer-trigger > .ab-item` click; closes on backdrop, close button, or Escape.
- Reuses server-rendered iframes via `frameCache`; prefetches on admin-bar hover (`mouseover`); resolves node IDs with or without `wp-admin-bar-` prefix.
- Sets iframe `src` to signed `frameUrl`; shows loading overlay until `iframe.onload`.
- Exposes `window.edminboostCcOpenDrawer( { label, frameUrl, openUrl } )` for Layout Studio preview (mapper enqueues this script even without live drawer items).

