## Menu Studio JS (`initMenuStudio`)

Key elements: `#edminboost-menu-studio-form` (`data-edminboost-custom-items`), `#edminboost-menu-canvas`, `#edminboost-menu-discovered-list`, `#edminboost-menu-hidden-inputs`, `#edminboost-menu-search`, `#edminboost-menu-canvas-empty`, custom link fields `#edminboost-menu-custom-path`, `#edminboost-menu-custom-label`, `#edminboost-menu-custom-parent`, `#edminboost-menu-custom-add` (Pro-gated); layout fields `#edminboost_menu_width`, `#edminboost_menu_font_size`, `#edminboost_menu_line_height`, `#edminboost_menu_letter_spacing`, `#edminboost_menu_display_mode` (Pro-gated), live preview `#edminboost-menu-layout-preview`; colors panel `#edminboost-menu-colors-panel` (always on — hidden `use_colors=1`), preview `#edminboost-menu-color-preview`, rows `.edminboost-menu-color-row`.

- Mirrors mapper drag/drop patterns for sidebar reorder, hide, and custom links (top-level + submenu under parent).
- Bootstraps `customItems` from `form.dataset.edminboostCustomItems` (avoids duplicating server-rendered custom rows).
- `applyLayoutPreview()` syncs `--eb-ms-preview-*` CSS vars and `--icon` / `--text` modifier classes on `#edminboost-menu-layout-preview`.
- `applyColorPreview()` syncs `--eb-ms-preview-*` color vars on `#edminboost-menu-color-preview` and `#edminboost-menu-layout-preview`; color picker ↔ hex text sync per row (includes `submenu_hover_text`).
- `syncHiddenInputs()` writes indexed hidden fields for `order`, `submenu_order`, `hidden_items`, and `custom_items` before submit.
- Hidden marker input: `command_center[_menu_studio_save]` = `1`.

## Mapper JS (`initMapper`)

Key elements: `#edminboost-mapper-form`, `#edminboost-topbar-items`, `#edminboost-topbar-canvas`, `#edminboost-discovered-list`, `#edminboost-topbar-hidden-inputs`, `#edminboost-item-drawer`, `#edminboost-mapper-look`, `#edminboost-plugin-search`, `#edminboost-drawer-preview`, `#edminboost-drawer-preview-wrap`.

- Canvas items: drag-reorder within canvas (`dragItem`, `effectAllowed: move`); keyed by `data-slug` + `data-anchor`.
- Discovered rows: drag-to-canvas (`dragPayload`, `effectAllowed: copy`); checkbox and row-click toggle add/remove (skipped when anchor is set).
- `setDiscoveredChecked()` keeps discovered `is-active` in sync with canvas membership for non-anchored slugs only.
- `syncPanelBadgesVisibility()` — uses shared `syncDependentSection()` on `#edminboost-mapper-look` when no canvas item has `interaction === drawer`; called from `syncHiddenInputs()`, interaction radio changes, and mapper init.
- `syncHiddenInputs()` writes indexed hidden fields for `top_bar_items` (including `anchor`) before form submit; always calls `syncPanelBadgesVisibility()` first.
- Custom link fields: `#edminboost-custom-link-path`, `#edminboost-custom-link-label`, `#edminboost-custom-link-anchor`; path may include `#fragment`.
