## Dependent section toggles (`syncDependentSection`, `initWhiteLabel`, `initSecurityFeatures`, `initProductivityFeatures`)

Shared helper `syncDependentSection( section, isEnabled )` applies the master-toggle pattern: add `.is-disabled` + `aria-disabled="true"` on the section wrapper; set `tabindex="-1"` / `aria-disabled="true"` on nested `input`, `textarea`, `select`, `button`, and `a[href]` controls (store prior `tabindex` in `data-edminboost-dependent-tabindex` and restore when re-enabled). Used by Top Bar `syncPanelBadgesVisibility()` (`#edminboost-mapper-look`), Theme extras scheduled dark mode (`#edminboost-theme-schedule-options`), White Label master toggle, Security login redirects, and Productivity dashboard widgets / admin footer.

