## AJAX save (`initCommandCenterForms` / `initSettingsForm`)

- Intercepts `.edminboost-cc-form` and `.edminboost-settings-form` submit; POSTs `FormData` to `edminboostData.settingsSave.ajaxUrl` with action `edminboost_save_settings`.
- Strips `action` from `FormData` first (`settings_fields()` adds `update` for options.php) before appending the plugin AJAX action.
- `saveSettingsForm( form, options )` returns a `Promise`; options: `reload`, `silent` (skip success notice), `message`, `onSuccess`.
- Uses nonce from form (`settings_fields()`); shows inline success/error notice unless `silent`; optional reload via `{ reload: true }`.
- Success payload may include `presets`, `selected_preset`, `active_layout_preset`, `default_preset`, `theme`, `setup_complete`, `message` — `applySettingsSaveResult()` syncs `edminboostData.presets` (and `syncPresetCatalogFn` when `active_layout_preset` or `selected_preset` is set), updates `edminboostData.themeSettings` + calls `syncThemeSettingsFn` on non-dashboard forms, and reloads Dashboard via CC nav when wizard completes.

## Pro locks JS (`initProLocks`)

- No-ops when `edminboostData.isPro`.
- Finds `.is-pro-locked` inside `root`; calls `syncDependentSection( section, false )` to disable nested controls.
- Restores keyboard access to `.edminboost-pro-upgrade a` (Billing links stay focusable).
- Called from `reinitEdminboostPage()` after CC tab AJAX swaps.

